We have "future_schedule": list of events with event_id, event_time, kind, quantity. These are future scenario events to be applied after we reconstruct the historical state at target_time. The future schedule events are applied starting from the reconstructed stock at target_time. They are applied in (event_time, event_id) order. The events are known to us exactly as given, not any hidden knowledge.

We must produce:

```
